# 1. Google Gemini AI API Key (100% Free forever: 15 req/min)
# Get your free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# (You can also paste it directly in the Admin Dashboard UI)
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# 2. Supabase Free PostgreSQL Database (500MB free forever)
# Get your free project at: https://supabase.com
